## High-risk files (explicit permission required)

These files contain integration invariants. One wrong edit can break every product page, lose checkouts, or leak data. Do not edit them casually. If Ting asks for a change here, explain the risk, propose the smallest safe approach, and wait for her clear permission before touching the file.

| Path | What's locked |
|---|---|
| `lib/shopify/**` | Storefront API client, queries, types, cart. |
| `lib/judgeme/**` | Reviews integration. |
| `lib/product-helpers.ts`, `lib/collection-page.ts` | Shared helpers used everywhere. |
| `app/api/**` | Server routes (cart, contact, subscribe, Instagram, Shopify cart proxy). |
| `app/products/[handle]/page.tsx`, `app/collections/[handle]/page.tsx`, `app/blogs/news/[handle]/page.tsx`, `app/blogs/news/page.tsx`, `app/collections/page.tsx` | Shopify-backed routes. The data-fetch shape, `notFound()` calls, and `try/catch` blocks must stay intact. Visual tweaks inside the JSX are fine if you do NOT touch the data-fetch lines at the top of the file. |
| `app/robots.ts`, `app/sitemap.ts`, `app/global-error.tsx` | SEO + root error boundary. |
| `next.config.ts` | The image host allowlist and quality settings. A wrong edit here silently breaks every product image across the whole site. Redirects used to live here but now live in `lib/redirects.ts`, so you never need to open this file. |
| `tsconfig.json`, `eslint.config.*`, `package.json`, `package-lock.json` | Toolchain. |
| `app/moissanite-guide/layout.tsx`, `app/pearl-guide/layout.tsx`, `app/bridal-guide/layout.tsx`, `components/hub/**`, `mdx-components.tsx` | The guide-hub scaffold, added 2026-07-06: shared layout, FAQ/CTA components, MDX element styling. This is structure, not the article itself, see the safe zone below for what you can edit. |
| `.env.example`, `.env.local`, `.env.*` | Secrets and env contracts. |
| `scripts/audit.ts`, `scripts/verify-*.mjs`, `scripts/probe-*.mjs` | Pre-launch and verification scripts. |
| `components/cart-provider.tsx` | Cart state. Subtle bugs lose checkouts. |
| `components/email-popup.tsx` constants `DELAY_*_MS`, `DISMISS_DAYS`, `STORAGE_KEY`, `SESSION_PV_KEY` | Timing and storage keys. Body visual edits inside the JSX are fine. Never change the constants at the top of the file. |

If Ting has not given clear permission for high-risk work, stop and ask her. Do not invent a safer-looking workaround in another file.

