## What you may always do without asking

- Edit static page content under `app/pages/*`.
- Tweak Tailwind classes, layout, spacing, motion inside any component (as long as you don't touch data-fetch lines in locked routes).
- Swap images in `public/`.
- Add new decorative components.
- Add new static pages and sections.
- Restructure the navigation and how pages are grouped (the page layer only, never the Shopify-backed routes).
- Add a redirect in `lib/redirects.ts` when you rename or remove a page.
- Add `export const metadata` to a new static page.

